msgid ""
"The default RC input is configured on UART2, and all ArduPilot compatible "
"protocols, except PPM and SBUS, are supported. SBUS support is provided via "
"the HD VTX connector on SERIAL1 and but requires the protocol be set to "
":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = \"23\" and to change "
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` to something other than '23'."
msgstr ""
"默认RC输入配置在UART2，支持除PPM和SBUS以外的所有ArduPilot兼容协议。SBUS支持通过HD图传接口上的SERIAL1提供，但需将协议设置为"
" :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = 「23」，并将 "
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` 改为非 「23」 的值。"

